# 🚀 SmartCampus — FGIET

### Built by Team CodeX 💻

A smart campus portal designed for **Feroze Gandhi Institute of Engineering and Technology (FGIET)** to make campus information and student services easier to access.

## 🌐 Live Demo
https://smart-campus-8b6f7.firebaseapp.com

## ✨ Features

- 🎓 Separate Student and Admin portals
- 📢 Campus notices and announcements
- 📅 Events and important deadlines
- 🔎 Lost & Found reporting
- 📚 Campus resources: Library, Labs, Clubs and Placement Cell
- 🔐 Firebase Authentication
- ☁️ Firebase Firestore integration

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Firebase Authentication
- Cloud Firestore
- Firebase Hosting

## 👥 Team

**Team Name:** CodeX

**Project:** SmartCampus — FGIET

## 🎯 Goal

To build a simple, accessible and secure campus portal that helps students find important campus information in one place.

## 📌 Project Status

Under development. Features and data may change as the project evolves.
